  "title": "Add and manage photos – Knowledge Base",
  "text": "Knowledge Base\nDaylio FAQ\nTutorials\nCreate and manage moods\nAdd note to entry\nAdd and manage photos\nSet up and track goals in Daylio\nChange font size and contrast\nChange language, the start of the week, or time format\nClear all data\nDelete account\nMove Daylio to new phone\nExport PDF\nWriting entries on computer\nUse multiple devices\nBackup and restore\nPurchases\nIssues\nAbout\nAll Docs\nAll Docs\nDaylio FAQ\nPopular Searches\nWordPress\nFooter\nLorem\nHome\nDaylio FAQ\nTutorials\nAdd and manage photos\n Updated on December 20, 2024\nDaylio FAQ\nTutorials\nCreate and manage moods\nAdd note to entry\nAdd and manage photos\nSet up and track goals in Daylio\nChange font size and contrast\nChange language, the start of the week, or time format\nClear all data\nDelete account\nMove Daylio to new phone\nExport PDF\nWriting entries on computer\nUse multiple devices\nBackup and restore\nPurchases\nIssues\nAbout\nAdd and manage photos\nEstimated reading: 2 minutes\n 8498 views\nAdding Photos\n\nWith Daylio you can attach up to 9 photos to your entry.\n\nWhen you pick your activities, scroll all the way down and tap on PHOTO (under the NOTE). You can take a new photo with a camera or use a photo from your library. \n\n🍎 iOS devices can select up to 9 photos at once in the picker. If you have an older device or downloading photos from iCloud, it might take a second to download photos to Daylio.\n\nPhotos can also be visible in the Photo Gallery (in the More menu) and in the PDF export (More > Export Entries).\n\nℹ️ To use this feature, you have to allow Daylio to open the Camera or access your Photos.\n\nDeleting Photos\n\nTo delete a photo you need to edit the entry which contains the photo. Here you can tap the red X button to delete photos and save changes.\n\nPhoto Gallery\n\nPhotos create a Photo Gallery displayed in section More > Photo Gallery. The gallery within our app displays all your photos associated with your entries.\n\nAdding a photo is automatic – all photos are displayed here.\n\nIn order to delete the photo from our app’s gallery, you need to open the associated day entry and delete the photo. To do so, please follow these steps:\n\nOpen Daylio’s Photo Gallery\nTap on the photo you want to delete\nTap on the Show Entry button\nTap on the day entry and then select Edit\nTap the red X in the upper right corner of the photo.\n\n Still stuck? How can we help?\n\nWas this page helpful? Yes 5 No 4\n\nShare this Doc\nA-\nA\nA+\n CONTENTS\nAdding Photos\nDeleting Photos\nPhoto Gallery\n\nPowered By EazyDocs\n\n© 2025 All Rights Reserved by Daylio",
